  autoFocusSpeaker: 1
  screens:
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 251ab17588978ca44861c552397cfd18, type: 2}
    dialog: Apprentice! Stop standing around, our lives depends on it!
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 268099729075732544
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bd43d09d02697ee489059e7390a0597d, type: 2}
    dialog: I'll be fine for now- you gotta help Ms. Ervine, Yuri...
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 268099729075732545
    - rid: 268099729075732563
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 639d4037fbc3acd41947392e6542aac6, type: 2}
    dialog: Ancano fires another ice spike toward Sayori, which Mirabelle blocks
      with a ward.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 268099729075732560
    - rid: 268099729075732561
    - rid: 268099729075732562
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 294377bcfa9c68d468fbdb53f597dc39, type: 2}
    dialog: ...
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 268099729075732546
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 294377bcfa9c68d468fbdb53f597dc39, type: 2}
    dialog: O-okay...
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 268099729075732547
    - rid: 268099729075732548
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 639d4037fbc3acd41947392e6542aac6, type: 2}
    dialog: Yuri summons her dagger to help in the fight against Ancano.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 268099729075732549
    - rid: 268099729075732550
    - rid: 268099729075732551
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: 
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 268099729075732552
    - rid: 268099729075732553
    - rid: 268099729075732554
    - rid: 268099729075732555
    - rid: 268099729075732557
    - rid: 268099729075732558
    - rid: 268099729075732559
    - rid: 268099729075732556
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 639d4037fbc3acd41947392e6542aac6, type: 2}
    dialog: Now that the battle is finished, Sayori drops the Staff of Magnus to
      focus on healing herself.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 268099729075732600
    - rid: 268099729075732601
    - rid: 268099729075732602
    - rid: 268099729075732603
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 294377bcfa9c68d468fbdb53f597dc39, type: 2}
    dialog: ... is it over, Ms. Ervine?
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 268099729075732612
    - rid: 268099729075732613
    - rid: 268099729075732614
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 251ab17588978ca44861c552397cfd18, type: 2}
    dialog: I hope so. We'll have to see if there are any lingering effects that
      came from Ancano's manipulation of the Eye.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 268099729075732615
    - rid: 268099729075732616
    - rid: 268099729075732618
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 251ab17588978ca44861c552397cfd18, type: 2}
    dialog: But- hm. What should we do about this thing, anyway?
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 268099795830177873
    - rid: 268099795830177874
